 126:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     Function @ref HAL_USART_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 127:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) TxHalfCpltCallback        : Tx Half Complete Callback.
 128:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) TxCpltCallback            : Tx Complete Callback.
 129:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxHalfCpltCallback        : Rx Half Complete Callback.
 130:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) RxCpltCallback            : Rx Complete Callback.
 131:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) TxRxCpltCallback          : Tx Rx Complete Callback.
 132:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) ErrorCallback             : Error Callback.
 133:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) AbortCpltCallback         : Abort Complete Callback.
 134:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) MspInitCallback           : USART MspInit.
 135:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     (+) MspDeInitCallback         : USART MspDeInit.
 136:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 137:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****     and a pointer to the user callback function.
