 294:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****   * @brief  Initialize the USART mode according to the specified
 295:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****   *         parameters in the USART_InitTypeDef and initialize the associated handle.
 296:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****   * @param  husart Pointer to a USART_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
 297:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_usart.c ****   *                the configuration information for the specified USART module.
